  "examples": [
    {
      "coptic": "ⲡϣⲏⲣⲉ ⲇⲉ ϣⲏⲙ ϥⲟⲩⲱϩⲙ ⲁⲩⲱ ϥ**ⲁⲛⲧⲓⲗⲉⲅⲉ** ·",
      "english": "but he who is still a child giveth vague orders and contradicteth himself.",
