      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:psephrem.asceticon.budge:1-23",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲧⲛⲁⲝⲓⲟⲩ ⲇⲉ ⲙⲙⲟⲕ ⲉⲧⲣⲉⲛⲥⲱⲧⲙ ⲉⲛⲉⲧⲕⲙⲉⲉⲩⲉ ⲉⲣⲟⲟⲩ . ⲉⲧⲃⲉⲧⲉⲓϩⲁⲓⲣⲉⲥⲓⲥ ⲅⲁⲣ ⲁⲩⲧⲁⲙⲟⲛ ϫⲉⲥⲉ**ⲁⲛⲧⲓⲗⲉⲅⲉ** ϩⲓⲱⲱⲥ ϩⲙⲙⲁ ⲛⲓⲙ .",
      "english": "But we desire to hear from you what you think. For, as concerning this sect, it is known to us that everywhere it is spoken against.'",
      "source": "44_Acts of the Apostles_28",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.acts.sahidica:28",
